{
  "title": "Calcium\u2013albumin interaction fails to improve DSST prediction across two NHANES samples",
  "abstract": "In 1,290 NHANES 2011\u20132012 adults aged 60+ and 1,497 separately sampled 2013\u20132014 adults, adding a calcium\u2013albumin interaction to flexible standard chemistry, albumin-adjusted calcium and demographic predictors changed validation weighted MSE by +0.034508 score\u00b2 (+0.0208%). The source-refit/target PSU-bootstrap 95% interval was [-0.452328, 1.006493]. This does not demonstrate incremental benefit or equivalence and does not rule out calcium\u2013cognition associations.",
